# Gerdalu Design System

Canonical tokens live at `gerdalo-frontend/src/styles/design-tokens.css`.
If that file is missing, ask where it is — never invent substitute colors or fonts.

## Colors

- Never hardcode hex in components. Always use CSS variables (e.g. `var(--yellow-500)`).
- Page color ratio (both themes): ~70% `--paper-0` / `--paper-100`, ~20% `--ink-900` for text/dark chrome (header/footer), ~10% `--yellow-500` for CTA, active links, badges, emphasis.
- Yellow must never be a full-page or large-section background.
- Product/order status colors only:
  - Draft → `--neutral` on `--neutral-bg`
  - Pending Review → `--warning` on `--warning-bg`
  - Approved → `--success` on `--success-bg`
  - Rejected → `--danger` on `--danger-bg`

## Theme

- Toggle via `data-theme="light"` or `data-theme="dark"` on `<html>`.
- If unset, follow `prefers-color-scheme`.
- Persist manual choice in `localStorage` key `theme`.
- Keep legacy `.dark-theme` class in sync for existing styles.

## Typography & direction

- Fonts: Persian (`lang="fa"`) → Vazirmatn (400/500/600/700/800); English (`lang="en"`) → Quicksand (300–700). Do not add other UI fonts.
- Default direction RTL; `lang="fa"` for Persian, LTR for English.

## Breakpoints

Defined only on the MUI theme (`create-app-theme` / `themeWebsiteDashboard`). Use MUI `sx` / `theme.breakpoints`: `xs`, `sm`, `md`, `xmd`, `lg`, `xl`.

| Token | Min width |
| ----- | --------- |
| `xs`  | 0px       |
| `sm`  | 600px     |
| `md`  | 900px     |
| `xmd` | 1024px    |
| `lg`  | 1200px    |
| `xl`  | 1536px    |

## Radii

Use only `--radius-sm` (10px), `--radius-md` (12px), `--radius-lg` (16px), `--radius-pill` (badges / circular buttons).

## Buttons

- Primary: bg `--yellow-500`, text `--ink-900`, border `--yellow-600`
- Secondary dark: bg `--ink-900`, text `--paper-0`
- Outline: border `--ink-900`, no background
- Ghost: border `--line`, text `--ink-700`

## Cards

Product/content cards: bg `--paper-0`, border `--line`, radius `--radius-lg`, shadow `--shadow-card`.
